                "text": "**Insecure Deserialization**\n\nVulnerabilities in the deserialization of untrusted data leading to code execution\n\n**Impact (type metadata)**\nRemote code execution, privilege escalation, denial of service, or data tampering\n\n**Mitigation (type metadata)**\nUse safe deserialization methods, validate object types, implement integrity checks"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/psyray/oasis"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
